    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\neSign Admissions Forms with Blueink\nSimplify admissions by collecting signatures on enrollment forms, waivers, and consent documents online.\nPaperless Admissions, Faster Processing\nBlueink’s eSignature solution speeds up admissions, reduces paperwork, and ensures compliance with FERPA.\nFERPA-Compliant Security\n\nProtect student data with encryption and compliance with FERPA and other education regulations.\n\nBulk Send for Mass Admissions\n\nSend enrollment packets to hundreds of applicants at once, with tracking and reminders.\n\nMobile-Friendly Signing\n\nApplicants and parents can sign admissions forms from any device, anywhere.\n\nModern approach to eSignature integrations\nBlueink’s core integrations line up with your preferred platforms and systems, driven both by our built-in integrations as well as our secondary connectors with Zapier, Nintex and Microsoft Power Automate. Each integration grants you increased productivity, peace of mind, and a shortened to-do list.\n\nWant more customization? Explore the API\n\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nStandard plan - 40% less\n\n$15\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$180 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nStandard Plan includes:\n120 Envelopes / User / Year\n5 Templates / User\nBlueink Payments\nAuto Detect Fields\nReal-time audit trail\nSMS Pin / Selfie / ID Authentication\nCC Additional Recipients\nEmail / Chat Support\nBusiness Pro\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nBusiness Pro plan - 25% less\n\n$30\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$360 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Standard features, plus:\n1800 Envelopes / User / Year\n12 Templates / User\nSMS Delivery\nReminder Emails\nCustom Messaging\nAttachment Fields\nMOST POPULAR\nBlueink Unlimited\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nProfessional Unlimited - 86% less\n\n$40\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$480 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Business Pro features, plus:\nUnlimited Envelopes / User / Year\nUnlimited Templates\nTeams\nSigning Brands\nEnterprise\n\nAdvanced Solutions\n\n\n\nLet’s talk\nUNLIMITED USERS\nContact Sales\nOther benefits include:\n\nUnlimited Users\nUnlimited Templates\nBulk Send\nSmart Link Forms\nCustom Reporting\nCustomer Success Team\nAPI and Embedded Signing Access\n\nLooking for quote? Request a personalized quote from Blueink.\n\nFAQs\nHow can I use Blueink to streamline student admissions?\n\nBlueink allows you to send admission forms electronically to parents or students for secure, legally binding eSignatures. You can also create reusable templates to speed up processing for multiple applicants.\n\nCan multiple parties sign the same admission form?\n\nYes. Blueink supports multi-party signing, allowing parents, guardians, or school officials to sign in a specific order or all at once.\n\nCan I track which forms have been signed and which are pending?\n\nAbsolutely. Blueink offers real-time tracking so you know exactly when documents are opened, signed, or pending.\n\nAre admission forms stored securely after signing?\n\nYes. All completed documents are safely stored in your Blueink Archive, where you can access them anytime along with downloadable audit trails.\n\nCan I send admission packets in bulk?\n\nYes. With Bulk Send feature, you can deliver the same form to multiple recipients at once, ideal for annual enrollment periods.\n\nReady to get started?\n\nGet in touch with Blueink.\n\nStart Free 14-Day Trial!\nFEATURES\nBulk Send\nSMS Delivery\nSmart Link Forms\nSigning Brands\nTeams\nIn-Person Signing\nSOLUTIONS\nINDUSTRY\nGovernment\nEducation\nHealthcare\nHousing\nInsurance\nStaffing\nSenior Living\n\nFinancial Services\nRetail\nTechnology\nDEPARTMENT\nFinance\nProcurement\nHuman Resources\nCourts\nLegal\nSales\nOperations\nCivil Service\nIT\nCOMPARE BLUEINK\nvs Adobe Sign\nvs DocuSign\nvs Dropbox Sign\nvs Foxit Sign\nvs PandaDoc\nvs SignNow\nAPI\nAPI Overview\nAPI SDKs & Libraries\nDocumentation\nAPI Plans & Pricing\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nWhite Papers\nCase Studies\nCompetitors\neSignature Laws\nHelp Center\nSample Documents\nFAQ\nCompliance\nSystem Status\nQUICK LINKS\nHome\nAbout Us\nPricing\nIntegration\nPartner\n\nContact Us\n2014 – 2026 © Blueink. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nCookies Policy"
